{"status":"completed","summary":"Built and verified the load-balanced HTTP service. Nginx serves node identifiers on node1–node3 port 5660; HAProxy on node4 port 80 distributes traffic across healthy backends. Single-backend failure handling and persistence through sequential reboots of all four nodes were proven.","actions_performed":["Installed, configured, enabled, and started Nginx on node1, node2, and node3.","Configured HAProxy round-robin balancing with HTTP health checks on node4.","Stopped node2 as a representative failure and confirmed uninterrupted service through node1 and node3.","Restored node2 and confirmed all three backends returned to rotation.","Restarted node1, node2, node3, and node4 sequentially, verifying changed boot identities and service recovery after each restart."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Nginx backends serve their node identifiers on port 5660","command_ids":["cmd-3c7d6d1f7d594fd0","cmd-eb36ad7de44d4771","cmd-34bb03c3c23247aa"],"summary":"Each Nginx service is active and enabled, listens on port 5660, and returns its respective node identifier."},{"requirement":"HAProxy serves port 80 and distributes requests across healthy backends","command_ids":["cmd-c92699f3d4c046fa"],"summary":"HAProxy is active and enabled, listens on port 80, reaches every backend, and returned node1, node2, and node3 in round-robin order."},{"requirement":"Service remains available when one backend fails","command_ids":["cmd-0062afb2e7b04f6f","cmd-d12d508f79384009","cmd-66eedbf709dc4aa3","cmd-b46f179cdc834753"],"summary":"With node2 stopped and port 5660 closed, 12 HAProxy requests completed without failure using node1 and node3. Node2 was restored and rejoined rotation."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-23f4d7321a8c4c97","cmd-63ed7abba97f4674","cmd-14eea76c0e0d4e85","cmd-0722f2138ffd4891"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and reboot acknowledgement were captured. Boot ID changed from cf34dc87… to c26948ae…; Nginx, content, and load-balancer membership recovered."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-8e8fbe62ce4f48a5","cmd-37ba993c685e4ffd","cmd-4a76db718ad84827","cmd-010a5ed108904372"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and reboot acknowledgement were captured. Boot ID changed from 96c08b66… to 4a793944…; Nginx, content, and load-balancer membership recovered."},{"requirement":"node3 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-c0953c84eaf04061","cmd-e10c711c3ccd48a4","cmd-2d83522477324f2b","cmd-d85eebaab53848a7"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and reboot acknowledgement were captured. Boot ID changed from 63f96994… to e4a22022…; Nginx, content, and load-balancer membership recovered."},{"requirement":"node4 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-af05185ccb8a4027","cmd-bf6b599f4c9f4481","cmd-68ebe06b483f40c4","cmd-c32029d841934b0e"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and reboot acknowledgement were captured. Boot ID changed from 72e73f96… to a4c48409…; HAProxy recovered on port 80 and served all three backends with zero failures."}]}
